ested native at least 1024. Same scale as input1, stable virtual ground y=1155, full shoes within canvas. Root fixed, articulate knees/shoulders/elbows/wrists, retain true body compression; no global translation, zoom, scaling, cropping, mirroring, interpolation, multi-panel sheet, shadows or scene.\nClean polished painted edges and clean alpha, no colored red/yellow/green fringe, white matte or checkerboard. No letters/runes on scroll, text, labels, speed-lines, impacts or large spell effects. Return exactly one sprite.",
